                "text": "Development of Scheduled Castes and Other Backward Classes."
              },
              {
                "type": "note",
                "text": "NOTE: The Ministry of Social Justice and Empowerment will be the nodal Ministry for overall policy, planning and coordination of programmes of development for Scheduled Castes and Other Backward Classes. In regard to sectoral programmes and schemes of development of these communities policy planning, monitoring, evaluation etc. as also their coordination will be the responsibility of the concerned Central Ministries, State Governments and Union Territory Administrations. Each Central Ministry and Department will be the nodal Ministry or Department concerning its sector."
